<html>
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=Cp1252">
    <meta name="generator" content="Helen">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="../../../../javahelp.css">
    <title>Undo a node creation</title>
  </head>
  <body bgcolor="#ffffff">
    <h1>
       <img border="0" hspace="0" s7starttagpos="276" height="32" width="32" src=
      "../../../../images/carmenHelpIcons/c3_32.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp; Deshacimiento de la creación de
      un nodo
    </h1>
    <table border="1" cellpadding="4" cellspacing="0" bordercolor="#000000" width="487">
      <col width="234">
      <col width="235">
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="477">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Use case: Undo a node creation</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="477">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Comment:</font></b> <font size="3">When undoing the creation of a
            node, the network remains in the same state that it was right before the amendment. The
            option to enable the undo of the creation of the node is the same for all kinds of
            undo. Depending on the order in which amendments have been made, undo one or the other.
            The steps that the use case have are as follows.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="477">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Actor: User</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Normal course</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="235">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Alternative courses</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">1.No matter what kind of edition and when the last action not undid is
            the creation of a node, the user clicks on the option to undo.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.All elements of the actual network are deselected.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">3.The use case <i>Updating the menus when changing the selected
            element</i> is executed.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">4.Las node created in the network is deleted.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">5.The use case <i>Updating the menus when modifying a network</i> is
            executed.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">6.The network is marked as modified (if it was not already), placing an
            asterisk at the title of the window in which is being editing.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
